<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - TV Filme started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - TV Filme started as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Oppenheimer &amp; Co said it started coverage of Brazilian pay-television operator TV Filme with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- set a price target of $20 on the stock for end-1997.  </p>
<p>-- &quot;At a more than 35 percent discount to our estimate of the company's value, the stock's current price represents an attractive entry level, despite its strong performance following its listing on Nasdaq,&quot; Oppenheimer said.</p>
<p>-- It estimated TV Filme would report a loss of $0.04 per share for 1996 and a profit of $0.39 for 1997.</p>
<p>-- TV Filme closed Wednesday at 15.</p>
<p>-- Jeff Daeschner 212-859-1610</p>
